{
  "slug": "codeflash",
  "name": "Codeflash",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Run Codeflash as a background agent in Claude Code to automatically optimize Python, Java, JavaScript, and TypeScript code for performance. Codeflash analyzes your code, benchmarks optimizations, generates verification tests, and open suggestions with verified speedups.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `optimize` (Optimize code for performance using Codeflash), `setup` (This skill should be used when codeflash fails to run due to missing installation, authentication issues, or missing…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install codeflash@claude-community` from `codeflash-ai/codeflash-cc-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "hook": 1
  },
